sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Operator
  participant W as apps/web
  participant I as apps/intelligence
  participant G as LLM gateway
  participant P as Provider (Anthropic / OpenAI / local)
  participant DB as Postgres (RLS)
  U->>W: "Build a 5-step trial-conversion journey"
  W->>I: POST /v1/copilot (org-scoped service token)
  I->>G: prompt + tools + brand-voice RAG
  G->>P: completion (streamed)
  P-->>G: tokens
  G-->>I: structured draft (segment / journey / email)
  I-->>W: stream draft + preview
  U->>W: accept
  W->>DB: persist via forTenant()
